Docker安装步骤
1.yum安装gcc相关
yum -y install gcc
yum -y install gcc-c++
2.安装所需的软件包
yum install -y yum-utils
3.设置stable镜像仓库
dnf config-manager --add-repo https://mirrors.aliyun.com/docker-ce/linux/centos/docker-ce.repo
4.更新yum软件包索引
yum makecache
5.安装docker ce
yum -y install docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io
6.启动docker
systemctl start dockcer
7.查看docker版本
docker version
